<title>FINLAND: Raisio seals venture with Emsland-Starke.</title>
<headline>Raisio seals venture with Emsland-Starke.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish food, feed and chemicals group Raision Tehtaat Oy said on Thursday it had sealed a deal with Emsland-Starke GmbH of Germany on a joint venture to market chemicals and starch products.</p>
<p>&quot;Raisio Chemicals ... and Emsland-Starke ... have decided to form a joint venture to sell and market the parent companies' chemicals and starch products to the paper industry in Germany, Austria and the Netherlands,&quot; Raisio said in a statement.</p>
</text>
